Yeah.
没错。

1371
00:45:23.700 --> 00:45:24.780
You can't see them at night.
你晚上根本看不见他们。

1372
00:45:24.860 --> 00:45:25.120
Yeah.
没错。

1373
00:45:25.220 --> 00:45:25.500
Yeah.
没错。

1374
00:45:25.720 --> 00:45:25.780
Exactly.
确实。

1375
00:45:26.640 --> 00:45:27.140
I'm sorry.
抱歉。

1376
00:45:27.360 --> 00:45:28.100
You go ahead.
你先请。

1377
00:45:28.840 --> 00:45:31.860
And also, you guys must have been there for each other for just fame.
而且，你们在面对成名这件事上一定也互相扶持吧。

1378
00:45:32.100 --> 00:45:34.840
Like what that weird experience is like of like getting recognized.
比如那种被人认出来的奇怪体验。

1379
