We are.
我们是。

1390
00:45:51.080 --> 00:45:51.760
We are.
我们是。

1391
00:45:52.100 --> 00:45:52.150
We are.
我们是。

1392
00:45:52.150 --> 00:45:52.200
We are.
我们是。

1393
00:45:52.200 --> 00:45:52.300
We are.
我们是。

1394
00:45:52.300 --> 00:45:52.440
We are.
我们是。

1395
00:45:53.540 --> 00:45:54.300
I know.
我知道。

1396
00:45:55.480 --> 00:45:59.340
Hindsight being what it is, would you have had done anything else with your characters
事后诸葛亮地想，如果能重来一次，你们会对自己的角色做些什么，

1397
00:45:59.340 --> 00:46:01.740
or anything different with your characters if you could go back and do it again?
或者对角色做出什么不同的处理吗？

1398
00:46:01.860 --> 00:46:02.340
You know what?
你知道吗？

1399
00:46:02.520 --> 00:46:02.920
Yes.
会。

1400
00:46:04.480 --> 00:46:09.260
I maybe would not have changed Pam's hair.
我可能不会改变帕姆的发型。

1401
00:46:09.900 --> 00:46:10.440
Really?
真的吗？

1402
00:46:10.840 --> 00:46:17.120
I kind of fought to change the frizzy mullet when she started dating Jim.
当她开始和吉姆约会时，我其实挺想改变她那头毛躁的鲻鱼头。

1403
00:46:17.320 --> 00:46:20.200
I said, I think she's growing as a person.
我说，我觉得她正在成长。

1404
00:46:20.580 --> 00:46:25.880
And I had this whole thing in my head character-wise that she was going to go to art school and she's
我当时在脑海里为这个角色构思了一整套设定，觉得她要去上艺术学校了，而且她

1405
00:46:25.880 --> 00:46:27.320
with her love now.
现在和爱人在一起。

1406
00:46:27.500 --> 00:46:31.960
